---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---
<Base>
  <p class="lede">
    Hi, I'm Nugraha, a Computer Engineering Technology student based in Semarang. Most of my days are spent inside Linux terminals, learning how systems break and how to lock them down.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    After solving hundreds of labs on HackMyVM, DockerLabs, and VulNyx, I started building vulnerable machines of my own and joined <a href="https://vulnyx.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">VulNyx</a> as a Nyx Team author. Four labs are live now: Groups, Ledger, Grenade, and Hannah Coffee, listed alongside my documentation log on <a class="ep" href="/milestones">milestones</a>. Whenever a manual task gets repetitive, I build small <a class="ep" href="/projects">projects</a> like Shellcraft and terminal consoles to automate it. I also publish loose thoughts and 300+ lab walkthroughs under <a class="ep" href="/writing">writing</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    I'm currently in my fifth semester at <a href="https://polines.ac.id/id" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Semarang State Polytechnic</a> with a 3.94 GPA and open to 2026 internships in cybersecurity or IT engineering. Feel free to connect via <a href={`mailto:${profile.links.email}`}>Email</a>, <a href={profile.links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>, or <a href={profile.links.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
